<section begin=Intro />'''Root''' (formerly known as ''Ensnare'') is a status effect that prevents affected units from moving, and from casting most mobility abilities. However, it does not prevent the affected units from turning, casting other abilities or using most items. Some root sources also [[disarm]] the affected units (and disarming roots were formerly known as ''Entangle'').<section end=Intro />

